    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alterspective is a perspective swapping open world adventure. Use your unique abilities to navigate an intriguing land full of colorful characters and mind-bending challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap Perspectives Anytime &amp; Anywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fully dynamic system allows you to slice the world and switch between side-scrolling and top-down perspectives with the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Mind-Bending Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the abilities you had all along! Chain your moves together to overcome increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewind to Fix Mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a jump? Not a problem! With rewind, you can focus purely on problem solving and performing impressive feats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Colorful Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alterspective features a vibrant cast of distinct characters with their own unique personalities and motivations. Who will you trust and forge friendships with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And More\u2026?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges by collecting <strong>300+ collectable pearls</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 unique biomes</strong> in a detailed hand-crafted open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expertly evade enemies in heart-pounding <strong>stealth sections</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose your path in life in an adaptive <strong>branching story</strong> with <strong>multiple endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fun <strong>mini-games</strong> and <strong>intense setpieces.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re brave enough, uncover some deeply <strong>hidden secrets</strong>\u2026</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alterspective is a perspective swapping open world adventure. Use your unique abilities to navigate an intriguing land full of colorful characters and mind-bending challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap Perspectives Anytime &amp; Anywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fully dynamic system allows you to slice the world and switch between side-scrolling and top-down perspectives with the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/7c63487ab92ba5ed39104b0e323f3bf9.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Mind-Bending Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the abilities you had all along! Chain your moves together to overcome increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/24d61f9d94e1c9709a955f74bcfd0fc3.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewind to Fix Mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a jump? Not a problem! With rewind, you can focus purely on problem solving and performing impressive feats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/af97d98f5b3df769723693e85b5945a9.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Colorful Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alterspective features a vibrant cast of distinct characters with their own unique personalities and motivations. Who will you trust and forge friendships with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.poster.avif?t=1752244892\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.webm?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868200/extras/ef5e22f32084950e93ed80621d0850a4.mp4?t=1752244892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And More\u2026?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges by collecting <strong>300+ collectable pearls</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 unique biomes</strong> in a detailed hand-crafted open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expertly evade enemies in heart-pounding <strong>stealth sections</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose your path in life in an adaptive <strong>branching story</strong> with <strong>multiple endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fun <strong>mini-games</strong> and <strong>intense setpieces.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re brave enough, uncover some deeply <strong>hidden secrets</strong>\u2026</p></li></ul>",
